    "sha256": "f118c46025ce8138ba5dcf55502890443fca441b9ff74fd33224c66c31875d8c",
    "k": 1,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "Now, listen to part two of the interview.",
    "zh": "现在请听访谈的第二部分。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "listen"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen003.png",
    "sha256": "6354fff96c8a0eb986d2d8d97fc3c9c756db3772e20fe880ad73fc0df9a3d2a3",
    "k": 2,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "Questions 6 to 10 are based on part 2 of the interview.",
    "zh": "第6至10题根据访谈的第二部分提问。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "be based on"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen004.png",
    "sha256": "354b9d5876a74654509ffb2d8d9f23a3e6984a3a611f292cb27d5b79731bccc0",
    "k": 3,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Thank you very much, Dr. Harley, for introducing some of the language teaching methods.",
    "zh": "非常感谢您，哈利博士，为我们介绍了几种语言教学方法。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "language teaching method"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen005.png",
    "sha256": "a5a66382b31b9f7d663f0f9f1ebb22ec12beb421a4a14dd3903695e4f6348f4e",
    "k": 4,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Now let’s move on to something a bit theoretical.",
    "zh": "现在，我们来谈一些稍微偏理论的话题。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "theoretical"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen006.png",
    "sha256": "6293d7d5d6c9e5ba2f5d856f70213e23f283f3cef6158ab66a369cbd26fa83b9",
    "k": 5,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Since second language acquisition and teaching are a fascinating area for researchers, are there any theories to explain second language acquisition?",
    "zh": "既然第二语言习得及其教学是一个令研究者着迷的领域，那么有没有什么理论可以解释第二语言习得呢？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "fascinating"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen007.png",
    "sha256": "e257ef38e90bea1dec918c6b46f99d4b0aaec9eb54512154c328aecb3b9612da",
    "k": 6,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Yes, many theories and models have been put forward by researchers so far.",
    "zh": "有的。到目前为止，研究者已经提出了许多理论和模型。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "put forward"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen008.png",
    "sha256": "f54538b85ee08a4f046f01a03a8f4a80f611a78693b30e56a0e65d09509e2b9e",
    "k": 7,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Today, I’d like to mention the five hypotheses proposed by Stephen Krashen.",
    "zh": "今天，我想介绍斯蒂芬·克拉申提出的五个假说。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "hypothesis"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen009.png",
    "sha256": "97523fae979bae09b4fefdf88f3579fee7c18e765b071166aaa3d9ad65ab07a8",
    "k": 8,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "OK.",
    "zh": "好的。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "OK"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen010.png",
    "sha256": "51a77bdd26e3d5d2158f35f1d4dff59cc8333287e7effe0b8d5d334737720652",
    "k": 9,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "The five hypotheses form what he calls the monitor model of second language learning.",
    "zh": "这五个假说构成了他所说的第二语言学习监控模型。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "monitor model"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen011.png",
    "sha256": "ea7bb91c368c66f17b4557b1456a23163564ad5a3aa1d4420fdcc96dcdb94d99",
    "k": 10,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "What does it mean?",
    "zh": "这是什么意思呢？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "What does it mean"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen012.png",
    "sha256": "bb4750ca4498e86e26679d07aca9be8e94fc562fe603ef61b6fcca5e36725ab4",
    "k": 11,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "OK. The first hypothesis is the acquisition and learning distinction hypothesis.",
    "zh": "好的。第一个假说是习得与学习区分假说。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "distinction"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen013.png",
    "sha256": "0e2cd232282a1587caf5241e92e51a742f564991ca32c01d8d64c65b6f984d46",
    "k": 12,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "According to Krashen, children acquire their first language largely unconsciously and automatically, ",
    "zh": "克拉申认为，儿童主要是在无意识、自然而然的过程中习得母语，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "unconsciously"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen014.png",
    "sha256": "44fde61b254be49a9dc3768eedca6a2b9c866e46d47feff57a8d62c335ea1ba7",
    "k": 12,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "but adults could only learn a second language consciously and effortfully.",
    "zh": "而成年人只能有意识地、付出努力地学习第二语言。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "effortfully"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen015.png",
    "sha256": "8e0bd2e67d9caa7515ec033f08536621a4f1fd4c6195981d9c3c7b26e1a651e7",
    "k": 13,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "And adults could indeed acquire the second language, at least in part.",
    "zh": "不过，成年人确实也能够习得第二语言，至少在一定程度上是这样。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "at least in part"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen016.png",
    "sha256": "3285698b7e5fb0275c1bd6f3927853f31b829557303b56aee98f31d05ccb37e5",
    "k": 14,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Right. Then what’s his second hypothesis?",
    "zh": "好的。那么，他的第二个假说是什么？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "hypothesis"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen017.png",
    "sha256": "3fb3dc0a607626e5c074fd614d9a1d32939dcdb224e941ce569c150dacfc9ae9",
    "k": 15,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "His second hypothesis is the natural order in acquisition hypothesis.",
    "zh": "他的第二个假说是习得自然顺序假说。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "natural order"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen018.png",
    "sha256": "91f50237589ce640d94db17041963e516a20e9d055704563c0a8ad3f8f0a729d",
    "k": 16,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Basically, he means that the order in which learners acquire syntactic rules is the same in both languages.",
    "zh": "基本意思是，学习者在两种语言中习得句法规则的顺序是相同的。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "syntactic rule"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen019.png",
    "sha256": "bdbf159446f0886c6e843b8ca88a080e7c0e78f75f84da087cb0970536f0f3aa",
    "k": 17,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Oh, that’s something really new to me.",
    "zh": "哦，这对我来说真是个全新的认识。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "new to me"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen020.png",
    "sha256": "209243be03d8adf30b21d267710a49ca21426c7dd9ffa5a63a8c9cc43ad696ad",
    "k": 18,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "The third hypothesis is the monitor hypothesis, which is central to his theory.",
    "zh": "第三个假说是监控假说，它是他整个理论的核心。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "central to"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen021.png",
    "sha256": "797c731e62c2fcd774cbea081c78e5de100c930b07c405b63496328dc2d9a5c7",
    "k": 19,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Here again, we come across the distinction between acquisition and learning.",
    "zh": "这里，我们再次遇到了习得与学习之间的区别。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "come across"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen022.png",
    "sha256": "61b726b1f92628b9c2067eb7681ad281296bcacfeafc8f42e53f7eb210e57c6c",
    "k": 20,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "According to this hypothesis, the acquisition processes create sentences in the second language, right?",
    "zh": "根据这个假说，习得过程负责生成第二语言的句子，对吧？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "acquisition"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen023.png",
    "sha256": "f65c5c02dc9cdf8d1675a8a244631fc8fb544c78cc072f97e52d150f6562eed8",
    "k": 21,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "But learning enables the development of a monitoring process to check and edit this output.",
    "zh": "而学习则能够形成一个监控过程，用来检查并修改这些语言输出。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "monitoring process"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen024.png",
    "sha256": "9d235e32cb515d7d707c0132d66fffa70beea6693b0715b22592539be6caaece",
    "k": 22,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "The monitor uses knowledge of the rules.",
    "zh": "这个监控机制运用的是语言规则方面的知识。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "rule"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen025.png",
    "sha256": "d297137b0288bc3501e5fea0c69c4324a3c203cb05bd537a3a9fd8a0c52797f9",
    "k": 23,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "That’s why, as I said just now, learning is a conscious process.",
    "zh": "所以，正如我刚才所说，学习是一个有意识的过程。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "conscious"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen026.png",
    "sha256": "8929323e78ca2007975d7fcf86757522065f13a34e51c52c3ce88a7144da01f5",
    "k": 24,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "This means, in learning, you use knowledge of the language to make sure what you say or write is correct.",
    "zh": "这意味着，在学习过程中，你会运用语言知识，确保自己所说或所写的内容正确。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "make sure"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen027.png",
    "sha256": "8d45f8fdffb95ffe4ed6c20217027a9f9dab0bf9afd7a3d32f335247fb201d5d",
    "k": 25,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Is that so?",
    "zh": "是这样吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "Is that so"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen028.png",
    "sha256": "2941df6c668a8fb76ec1174e330f33fc55c0c71e346123d6f361c0f4aaedf482",
    "k": 26,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Yes. His fourth hypothesis is the comprehensible input hypothesis.",
    "zh": "是的。他的第四个假说是可理解输入假说。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "comprehensible input"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen029.png",
    "sha256": "ab3e807093fc951550a71474ea3c96fa759ffb05bd3c9cc9c6d41e2d8c98f1e5",
    "k": 27,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "In order to move from one stage to the next, the learner must understand the meaning and the form of the input.",
    "zh": "学习者要从一个阶段进步到下一个阶段，就必须理解输入内容的意义和形式。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "input"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen030.png",
    "sha256": "03671e13489cc5a29bd30aec01a1cd8b8b21a8d878e46532599f459ad3eed1cb",
    "k": 28,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "This emphasizes the role of comprehension.",
    "zh": "这强调了理解所起的作用。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "comprehension"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen031.png",
    "sha256": "d927efd511914feeae90719ec0416a1506866dc3a7fcbd4fdb805b26fe99e71c",
    "k": 29,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "And finally, the active filter hypothesis.",
    "zh": "最后，是情感过滤假说。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "filter"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen032.png",
    "sha256": "16eb19fe10621c8ca7e84d8c740eb595da0f51114962fc46dfa4d056dcb7ad24",
    "k": 30,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "This suggests attitude and emotional factors are also important in second language acquisition.",
    "zh": "这一假说认为，态度和情感因素在第二语言习得中也很重要。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "emotional factor"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen033.png",
    "sha256": "98077fcb093232be21c406c2334ac0b7908bda66fc3e37b01f65f048060e9bb0",
    "k": 31,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I guess Krashen’s model has provided a useful framework for second language learning.",
    "zh": "我想，克拉申的模型为第二语言学习提供了一个有用的框架。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "framework"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen034.png",
    "sha256": "e5cb755479c3398516c046a6b6381ce15d5e65424e57318f7d9489d1b64bd641",
    "k": 32,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Yes, it indeed has and it has also proved to be one of the most influential theoretical approaches to teaching a second language.",
    "zh": "是的，确实如此，而且它也已被证明是第二语言教学中最有影响力的理论路径之一。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "influential"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen035.png",
    "sha256": "200367870cde97baff7ea63bd8e242c071c6f6249b93942a7eca0da883d36102",
    "k": 33,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "OK, Dr. Harley. Thank you once again for talking to us about second language acquisition.",
    "zh": "好的，哈利博士。再次感谢您与我们探讨第二语言习得。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "once again"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen036.png",
    "sha256": "9ea084a30f4e20ac5e039728432d751aa9251964d1876cd38bb2c134b4ae830a",
    "k": 34,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Pleasure.",
    "zh": "不客气。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "Pleasure"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen037.png",
    "sha256": "0a2fe53048b4a38e8478d5d189bc041e449b6b14a329c8803f130df47d7a9098",
    "k": 35,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "This is the end of part two of the interview.",
    "zh": "访谈的第二部分到此结束。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "end"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen038.png",
    "sha256": "c4c733a905deecf972f6198dc712b63aa2830f123ae23c8dbca9feb7dc13d801",
    "k": 36,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "Questions six to ten are based on what you have just heard.",
    "zh": "第6至10题根据你刚才听到的内容提问。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "be based on"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen039.png",
    "sha256": "9506dab3ce1f1f3f9dcc2e925111d0ffd1ee75c29a224cb96708595c30b4c9ff",
    "k": 37,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "question",
    "en": "Question 6. What can we learn from Krashen's first hypothesis?",
    "zh": "从克拉申的第一个假说中，我们能了解到什么？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "hypothesis"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen040.png",
    "sha256": "737953c40444cf49086d753cd933990d7b9f4a5920a0deada0732c01fc2f7310",
    "k": 38,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "question",
    "en": "Question 7. Which hypothesis deals with the role of language knowledge in the learning process?",
    "zh": "哪个假说讨论了语言知识在学习过程中的作用？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "deal with"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen041.png",
    "sha256": "fb9f43188ad0214550766e659da48e384cc2af410a64b0cbf3411f4a6411c16c",
    "k": 39,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "question",
    "en": "Question 8. What do we learn about the monitor hypothesis?",
    "zh": "关于监控假说，我们了解到什么？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "monitor hypothesis"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen042.png",
    "sha256": "9b417a4e5b5c1464c6157312b7c3b0a6465a7cea8d20c9026a0023573b42ef4d",
    "k": 40,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "question",
    "en": "Question 9. Which hypothesis deals with the role of emotional factors in language learning?",
    "zh": "哪个假说讨论了情感因素在语言学习中的作用？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "emotional factor"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen043.png",
    "sha256": "dc87000f488eada9d04fd719a94fa75156af7aea283a0686d07d8657c7905398",
    "k": 41,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "question",
    "en": "Question 10. What topic is NOT discussed during the interview?",
    "zh": "访谈中没有讨论哪个话题？",
    "vocabulary": [
